# OverKart Library (LibraryDecomp copy)

This directory is the live OverKart Library, compiled with **IDO** and linked into the mk64 ELF. It is not the GCC/Armips sibling `Library/` tree.

This directory must match the same folder in AmpedUpDecomp, OverKartDecomp, and LibraryDecomp. `OverKartDefaults.c` stays the shared `*Default` trampolines; host bodies forward from there and live outside this folder. Vanilla already calls those symbols. See **`docs/host_overrides.md`**.

Vanilla C must include `OverKartHooks.h`, not `MainInclude.h`.

# Working Rules

## Data contract

Treat the Tarmac → Library → host data contract as frozen. Course headers, object layouts, and `ok_HeaderROM` at `0xBE9178` are shared across C# writers and C readers.

## RAM map

- Payload (`.overkart`) at `0x80400000`. OKHeader BSS may overflow into `0x80500000`; must not reach FB0 at `0x805DA800`.
- Z at `0x80300000`. FBs at `0x805DA800` (FB0) / `0x80600000` (FB1) / `0x80700000` (FB2).
- `gFaceBuffer` at `0x80625800` growing forward. Vtx from `0x80700000` back. DLs from `0x80800000` back.
- `FreeMemory` 768 KB at `0x801978D0`–`0x802578D0`. `ok_ObjectPool` is leftover to `0x80400000` for `LoadOKData`.
- `ok_FreeSpace` is a temp scratch pad for **non-course** compressed data. Do not move it onto the course pools.
- Full map: **`docs/host_overrides.md`**.

Keep `OKHeader.h` and `OKHeader.asm` in lockstep. Do not invent new RAM without asking.

## Regions

NTSC (USA) only for Tarmac and custom levels. Do not mix region offsets.

## Library bloat

Do not clean, modernize, or delete "unused" Library code. Other hosts may still depend on it.

## Stack and style

N64 C is IDO. Do not switch to GCC. Do not change ABI or microcode unless asked.

## Shared copy

This directory must match the same folder in AmpedUpDecomp, OverKartDecomp, and LibraryDecomp. Do not fork, specialize, or host-patch files here. Host differences belong outside this directory (`src/AmpedUp/`, `src/OverKart5/`, vanilla hooks). KartCheck and CameraCheck are host-owned.
